title: The Emacs diff-view integration test takes 42 s, probably from two 20-second waits that time out every run.
pid: 8708a388-cce4-4893-a72d-a5dbe7609fa6
body: |2-
  It commits twice, and each step that commits ends by waiting up to
  20 s for the editor to be still, ignoring a timeout. The same test on
  the Neovim client takes 2 s, and it took 42 s both on all cores and
  on four efficiency cores, so it is waiting, not working. That is a
  fifth of the suite. Claude can likely find and fix it in under an
  hour (an estimate).
